<title>USA: CFM Majestic Inc president resigns.</title>
<headline>CFM Majestic Inc president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada-based CFM Majestic Inc said on Wednesday that Dennis Dillon has resigned as director, president and chief operating officer for personal reasons.</p>
<p>Colin Adamson, chairman and chief executive, will serve as interim president, the company said.</p>
<p>CFM said it is currently searching for a replacement and expects to make an announcement shortly.</p>
